OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police officer sacked over
OL,4,Asocial media posts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Metropolitan Police officer has been
OL,7,Fsacked for posting social media videos
OL,8,Fin which he described the force as
OL,9,Fcorrupt, called colleagues "liars",
OL,10,F"wastemen" and "batty holes", and
OL,11,Fpublished material that could have
OL,12,Fidentified an officer under a anonymity
OL,13,Fdirection.
OL,15,FPC Idominik Efeotor posted video
OL,16,Fcontent about life as a black police
OL,17,Fofficer under his podcast 'The Good,
OL,18,Fthe Bad and the Ugly', which has been
OL,19,Fshortlisted for two awards.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
