OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police officer sacked over
OL,4,Asocial media posts
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the videos, he is critical of the
OL,7,FMet and its directorate of professional
OL,8,Fstandards (DPS).
OL,10,FAn accelerated gross misconduct hearing
OL,11,Ffound that in posting these videos, he
OL,12,Fbreached the standards of professional
OL,13,Fbehaviour. He was dismissed without
OL,14,Fnotice.
